      "title": "epan: Add static ensure_contiguous_unsigned functions",
      "message": "epan: Add static ensure_contiguous_unsigned functions\n\nAdd static function variants of ensure_contiguous_no_exception and\nensure_contiguous that take unsigned offset and lengths, and validate\nthe offset and length without doing the extra steps to handle negative\ninputs and compute the absolute offset and lengths. Use those in a\ncouple of places where we're calling ensure_contiguous but already have\nunsigned offset and lengths.\n\nEventually this should replace ensure_contigous once all signed offsets\nand lengths are not supported. (We will probably need an\nensure_contiguous_remaining or similar.)\n\nPing #20103\n",
